# AI engineering (test automation)

> AI accelerates work; tests and architecture rules enforce correctness.
> Full policy: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [ADR-010](../../docs/adr/010-skills-first-test-authoring.md).

## Skills first (default)

When writing or changing tests, page objects, or locators:

1. Load `.cursor/skills/opencart-qa-workflow/SKILL.md`
2. Load TestDino `core` and `pom` from `.agents/skills/playwright-skill/`
3. Extend existing `src/features/<name>/` and use `POMFixture` (UI) or `ApiFixture` / `{ request }` (API)
4. Verify with `npx playwright test`; live UI checks in Cursor use **IronBee only** (`ironbee-devtools-use.mdc`)

## Allowed

- Page object and test spec generation via skills + existing patterns
- Refactoring within feature module boundaries
- Documentation and ADR drafts
- Debugging flaky tests and locator improvements (prefer `opencart-debug-playbook`)
- `.github/agents/` planner / generator / healer **only when the user explicitly requests them**

## Forbidden

- Bypassing CI quality gates or weakening assertions to make tests pass
- Introducing `src/pages/`, `src/api/`, or flat layouts superseded by `src/features/`
- Committing secrets or real credentials
- Unreviewed changes to credential/CI policy without ADR
- Playwright Test MCP (`playwright-test`, `browser_*`, `generator_*`, `planner_*`, `generator_write_test`) unless the user explicitly asks
- chrome-devtools MCP for authoring or exploring specs unless the user explicitly asks
- Using `playwright-cli` sessions as a substitute for a committed `POMFixture` / feature-module spec

## Opt-in MCP agents

- `.github/agents/playwright-test-planner.agent.md`
- `.github/agents/playwright-test-generator.agent.md`
- `.github/agents/playwright-test-healer.agent.md`
- `src/tests/seed.spec.ts` — generator scaffold (`testIgnore` in config)

These require enabling `playwright-test` MCP locally. Generated drafts must be refactored to `POMFixture` / feature services before commit. See [docs/test-generation-from-seed.md](../../docs/test-generation-from-seed.md).

## Required validation

All AI-generated code is **UNVERIFIED** until:

- `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint` pass
- Relevant Playwright tests pass
- Architecture rules in `10-architecture.mdc` are satisfied
- Code review protocol applied for significant changes (`80-code-review.mdc`)
